{"id":"wb-5-140","name":"热瓦克佛寺遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"热瓦克佛寺遗址","text":"热瓦克佛寺遗址（拉丁维文：Rawak，译为亭台楼阁）也称拉瓦克、洛瓦克、姚瓦克，是坐落于新疆维吾尔自治区和田地区洛浦县的唯一一处具有健驮逻国建筑风格的于阗佛教文化遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%83%AD%E7%93%A6%E5%85%8B%E4%BD%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92350888,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92350888","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/89f4495a97f9b6ff6553a6ba.jpg","title":"Rawak_BLP470_PHOTO1125_16_387.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rawak_BLP470_PHOTO1125_16_387.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/Rawak_BLP470_PHOTO1125_16_387.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"John Falconer","license":"CC BY-SA 1.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/1.0","caption":"​热瓦克佛寺的佛塔遗址，位于中国新疆和阗。","width":320,"height":215}}